// plague_city's Bless — Healer's prayer pulse. AbilityId 1
// (alphabetical: Bless < Cure < LastRites). The Healer's ScanAndHeal-
// style rule fires this on visibly-sick neighbours, but only when an
// rng.action() draw lands in the lower half (the .sim's body-side
// gate). The chronicle-side ApplyHealOrCure consumer treats amounts
// less than 25 as Bless (heal only, no infection clear) so this
// ability provides palliative HP top-up without curing the disease.
//
// Lowers to AbilityProgram { gate: { cooldown_ticks: 0,
//                                    hostile_only: false },
//                            area: SingleTarget { range: 3.5 },
//                            effects: [EffectOp::Heal { amount: 2.0 }] }.

ability Bless {
    target: ally
    range: 3.5
    cooldown: 0

    heal 2
}
